---
title: "pause / unpause (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: legionOperator calls pause() or unpause()
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not legionOperator
    q_check_auth --> q_check_action: caller is legionOperator
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_action --> q_pause: action == pause
    q_check_action --> q_unpause: action == unpause
    q_pause --> q_check_not_paused: paused == false
    q_pause --> q_revert_already_paused: paused == true
    q_revert_already_paused --> [*]: revert AlreadyPaused
    q_check_not_paused --> q_emit_paused: paused = true
    q_emit_paused --> [*]: emit Paused()
    q_unpause --> q_check_is_paused: paused == true
    q_unpause --> q_revert_not_paused: paused == false
    q_revert_not_paused --> [*]: revert NotPaused
    q_check_is_paused --> q_emit_unpaused: paused = false
    q_emit_unpaused --> [*]: emit Unpaused()

    note right of q_check_action
        INV-001: Only legionOperator can pause/unpause
        INV-002: Pause suspends invest, claimTokenAllocation, withdrawExcessInvestedCapital
        INV-003: Pause does NOT block investor fund access (withdrawInvestedCapitalIfCanceled, emergencyWithdraw)
    end note
